{
  "scenario": "A threat intelligence bundle on Operation Quiet Invoice, a fictional phishing campaign against a UK building society. It holds the threat actor, intrusion set and campaign; the real ATT&CK attack patterns and Rclone tool they use; the InvoiceDrop dropper and LedgerRAT implant with their command and control infrastructure; the email, files, processes, domain, addresses and network traffic observed on the victim's network; and the indicators, sighting, sandbox analysis, courses of action, opinion and TLP:AMBER report around them. Names, domains (example.*) and addresses (203.0.113.0/24, AS64500) are reserved for documentation; hashes are illustrative.",
